WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Can vaccinating mothers in pregnancy protect newborns from RSV?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
MATISSE vaccinated 3682 pregnant women, and 3676 received placebo.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Efficacy against severe RSV illness in the first 90 days: 81.8%.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
33 severe cases with placebo. 6 after maternal vaccination.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Still 69.4% at 180 days.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Against illness of any severity: 57.1%, short of the success criterion.

7
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Maternal RSVpreF vaccine protected infants from severe RSV. N Engl J Med, 2023. Scroll for the full breakdown.
